date]} {:db/id "q-337833" :question/id #uuid "9da44061-75cb-556f-b5b9-b8feb953b691" :question/math-academy-id "q-337833" :question/problem "Given that $D=\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+5\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}+1,$ what is $D(y)$ for $y=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)?$" :question/worked-solution "The given operator is a second-order differential operator of the form\n\n$$\nD(y)={a}_{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{a}_{1}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{a}_{0}y\n$$\n\nwith constant coefficients  ${a}_{2}=1,{a}_{1}=5,$ and ${a}_{0}=1.$ \n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D(y) & =D(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)) \\\\  & =(\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+5\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}+1)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x) \\\\  & =\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x))+5\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x))+1\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(x) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x))+5\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x) \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)+5\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x) \\\\  & =5\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-337833/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ec3823db-6df8-502a-a050-b5aa169d2e9d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-337833"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-91033/selection/5ea5a0b24b89a2d07b7c2012adf1c2de11078cb91650759b751da497f19f0e97" :answer/id #uuid "8ce00ee8-937b-5f20-a6e3-d21130db359c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-91033/selection/6855e0ce654277f2dfee68326294d7fbb4fb8961c108e655661b2eba949f877b" :answer/id #uuid "992e8b5e-a87d-5bea-9202-002881c0e20d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-91033/selection/76db9f014c0319928a969a702789251f63b5b93900b2e184e024d60a5e6123f9" :answer/id #uuid "079ccabc-bf6b-5fdd-a8e5-818af64f65bf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-91033/selection/fb9c44ff249b05b9e68098083847081fdafea153ce25d334811000fa66ab3d1f" :answer/id #uuid "133ff577-7ccc-5218-8a8d-19c32d1e8553" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-91033/selection/aec903952ab7a1aa6a6a87392036510631fb67237e61586043dc0a496a15b1a4" :answer/id #uuid "66a36f27-0d45-5d19-889e-b062b351b528" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-91033/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "64f7fd70-b843-53d1-b628-88970efb83be" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-91033/selection/5ea5a0b24b89a2d07b7c2012adf1c2de11078cb91650759b751da497f19f0e97" :answer-field/choices ["q-91033/selection/5ea5a0b24b89a2d07b7c2012adf1c2de11078cb91650759b751da497f19f0e97" "q-91033/selection/6855e0ce654277f2dfee68326294d7fbb4fb8961c108e655661b2eba949f877b" "q-91033/selection/76db9f014c0319928a969a702789251f63b5b93900b2e184e024d60a5e6123f9" "q-91033/selection/fb9c44ff249b05b9e68098083847081fdafea153ce25d334811000fa66ab3d1f" "q-91033/selection/aec903952ab7a1aa6a6a87392036510631fb67237e61586043dc0a496a15b1a4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-91033" :question/id #uuid "c2d18a34-5a8f-51af-9b4a-6e6117d9487f" :question/math-academy-id "q-91033" :question/problem "Given that $D=\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}-2\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x},$ what is $D(y)$ for $y=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x?$" :question/worked-solution "The given operator is a second-order differential operator of the form\n\n$$\nD(y)={a}_{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{a}_{1}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{a}_{0}y\n$$\n\nwith constant coefficients  ${a}_{2}=1,{a}_{1}=-2,$ and ${a}_{0}=0.$ \n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D(y) & =D(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x) \\\\  & =(\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}-2\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x})(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x) \\\\  & =\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)-2\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)-2(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x) \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-91033/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ec3823db-6df8-502a-a050-b5aa169d2e9d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-91033"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130252/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "84ae7a16-6e9a-569e-9496-f3db32633a65" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130252/selection/3eda535939e6680eafce490750e2779a3c27d3a16adcd08af749739689f10abf" :answer/id #uuid "0bdbec80-1f0a-592f-9945-c3c373030cd9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130252/selection/b5fd627ffaa20b5ed863243756a9807c0a3cfef51d6f8669d283ef0d17fadd00" :answer/id #uuid "1bf8a170-d6c9-5c27-83b9-59323277b984" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130252/selection/8e795e49dc3c76c815e74ff291bad4e5b6b7498a46573bab475f336bc7358ab3" :answer/id #uuid "d0ec9ebc-c7e5-5d15-a052-83542cf70dd5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130252/selection/208eb084c0c5223e1ab34651c34b36ae394af29ffd4076b27ab1071ad13b9ba8" :answer/id #uuid "6f827385-78b8-5074-abc7-072244379424" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130252/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "81214fda-192d-516c-a355-68e6587cfd45" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-130252/selection/8e795e49dc3c76c815e74ff291bad4e5b6b7498a46573bab475f336bc7358ab3" :answer-field/choices ["q-130252/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-130252/selection/3eda535939e6680eafce490750e2779a3c27d3a16adcd08af749739689f10abf" "q-130252/selection/b5fd627ffaa20b5ed863243756a9807c0a3cfef51d6f8669d283ef0d17fadd00" "q-130252/selection/8e795e49dc3c76c815e74ff291bad4e5b6b7498a46573bab475f336bc7358ab3" "q-130252/selection/208eb084c0c5223e1ab34651c34b36ae394af29ffd4076b27ab1071ad13b9ba8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-130252" :question/id #uuid "176ec5e1-5571-58a7-aa73-8c65d654e715" :question/math-academy-id "q-130252" :question/problem "Given that $D=\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}+2\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x},$ what is $D(y)$ for $y={sin}^{2}⁡x?$" :question/worked-solution "The given operator is a third-order differential operator of the form\n\n$$\nD(y)={a}_{3}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}+{a}_{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{a}_{1}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{a}_{0}y\n$$\n\nwith constant coefficients  ${a}_{3}=1,{a}_{2}=0,{a}_{1}=2,$ and ${a}_{0}=0.$ \n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D(y) & =D(\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x) \\\\  & =(\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}+2\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}){sin}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}({sin}^{2}⁡x)+2\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({sin}^{2}⁡x) \\\\  & =\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x)+2\\cdot (\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x)+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x \\\\  & =-4\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-130252/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ec3823db-6df8-502a-a050-b5aa169d2e9d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130252"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-337831/selection/0cfc1b06af2c5c366a5760a6af4455a5c1c9949926e8132b4a4ee8a52a8fee21" :answer/id #uuid "354dd450-d6cc-57c6-bb4d-861dca902542" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-14\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)+6\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337831/selection/3e40478d7a45abe06a3feb1d721852e34a65c9599232205083e773a4e2ffc3ff" :answer/id #uuid "194c681c-c646-5a66-8458-bc73573429b2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-9\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)+6\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337831/selection/df32cdad71c54550e2f6cd2620be51b2f6ad0c90d9b49df6bbc8a1aeec187cab" :answer/id #uuid "c9af11ee-630b-5742-a055-da9f96232364" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-14\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)-6\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337831/selection/cafff5431429b246c9e8d8be350907bd251084ad5b7b85856b0222d8d81063e1" :answer/id #uuid "ed5796e3-a93d-57e1-b325-f061cabd98e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "14\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)+6\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337831/selection/bb97701e01606279cd7f714a674dd97ba6f36ee1978b56cb2d3c09f6699250c3" :answer/id #uuid "0c19ca43-92a5-5bde-b5b0-5c681b0e6edf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337831/selection" :an