n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D(y) & =D({x}^{4}) \\\\  & =({x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}-2x\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+x\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}){x}^{4} \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}({x}^{4})-2x\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}({x}^{4})+x\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{4}) \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(4{x}^{3})-2x\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4{x}^{3})+x(4{x}^{3}) \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(12{x}^{2})-2x(12{x}^{2})+4{x}^{4} \\\\  & ={x}^{2}(24x)-24{x}^{3}+4{x}^{4} \\\\  & =24{x}^{3}-24{x}^{3}+4{x}^{4} \\\\  & =4{x}^{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-91045/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7ff7f935-dcec-5b4c-ba1d-e0b4c9e197a4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-91045"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-337840/selection/342fad29dd857039ae86a7d14ec9354fb5a32c964a021f8c72c765b68f18338d" :answer/id #uuid "0ac74c9f-3218-528a-9004-b36fe07e7ab1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{2}+6x-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337840/selection/e63f05ab1472481e0fb580de734d10f7a89fb909e7bb5239cbaf8ee64f8f4595" :answer/id #uuid "28ac6538-ea47-5a24-9c99-191a9df89709" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6x-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337840/selection/f003ff3cc3375caecd8d42d06a8be426c076efd8b49c6ad0c2854f05858bcee0" :answer/id #uuid "067d4a2d-dd13-518b-8dc3-ab29eb9eeaaf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4{x}^{2}+6x+2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337840/selection/ea49ab7e54ec96c9fad3f1befd65e4a2d76511282a8f52cbd114b587866e59cd" :answer/id #uuid "65d6b453-e27d-5101-9a92-e394a845b556" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4{x}^{2}-6x-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337840/selection/2bb4c11adfa7422a327772311fe52f45bebcb0e28b5e6a38d0aff26551907d95" :answer/id #uuid "39ebd7fe-94dc-5ed5-b467-b482447fd71e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4{x}^{2}+6x-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337840/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "173ee987-de08-5249-b8e6-d86335481597" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-337840/selection/2bb4c11adfa7422a327772311fe52f45bebcb0e28b5e6a38d0aff26551907d95" :answer-field/choices ["q-337840/selection/342fad29dd857039ae86a7d14ec9354fb5a32c964a021f8c72c765b68f18338d" "q-337840/selection/e63f05ab1472481e0fb580de734d10f7a89fb909e7bb5239cbaf8ee64f8f4595" "q-337840/selection/f003ff3cc3375caecd8d42d06a8be426c076efd8b49c6ad0c2854f05858bcee0" "q-337840/selection/ea49ab7e54ec96c9fad3f1befd65e4a2d76511282a8f52cbd114b587866e59cd" "q-337840/selection/2bb4c11adfa7422a327772311fe52f45bebcb0e28b5e6a38d0aff26551907d95"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-337840" :question/id #uuid "20114241-062d-543a-9f4f-ce748afabc7d" :question/math-academy-id "q-337840" :question/problem "Given that $D={x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+3\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}+2,$ what is $D(y)$ for $y={x}^{2}-1?$" :question/worked-solution "The given operator is a second-order differential operator of the form\n\n$$\nD(y)={f}_{2}(x)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{f}_{1}(x)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{f}_{0}(x)y\n$$\n\nwith ${f}_{2}={x}^{2},{f}_{1}=3,$ and ${f}_{0}=2.$\n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D(y) & =D({x}^{2}-1) \\\\  & =({x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+3\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}+2)({x}^{2}-1) \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}({x}^{2}-1)+3\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2}-1)+2({x}^{2}-1) \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2x)+3(2x)+2({x}^{2}-1) \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\cdot 2+6x+2{x}^{2}-2 \\\\  & =4{x}^{2}+6x-2\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-337840/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7ff7f935-dcec-5b4c-ba1d-e0b4c9e197a4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-337840"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-337848/selection/7d1e573e2a541b95245397012198d28d2668125d7d9eca13de1e13591f5f44f7" :answer/id #uuid "863e9f47-6fa3-510b-91e4-06f6323bed24" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "({x}^{2}+1)(7-{x}^{2})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337848/selection/fb812ffd84da24ce1905765231549b8c11e7a6abc4700344a3e0ae39ccca6462" :answer/id #uuid "223dfda0-35ad-5c39-8074-0f7b04fa46bf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "({x}^{2}+1)(7+2{x}^{2})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337848/selection/2ba3c326dd31af5a3a31342086047c8ca0cba4af4cd050440085abb1863140ff" :answer/id #uuid "0a5a232e-a789-527f-85c5-425e994be4c0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "({x}^{2}+1)(7-2{x}^{2})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337848/selection/707cc305f73f9e9a66cc6e545ada6c2812af62d26cf69d93ba13aec2868ca0c4" :answer/id #uuid "682e03e4-17c9-57f4-acdd-544faeaad16e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "({x}^{2}+1)(5-2{x}^{2})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337848/selection/32312e2fc4467bcf9f4791776f2c8ab86e5e7f4c222b59823acb03cb87c4681a" :answer/id #uuid "4317f84e-faf3-575d-b16c-15ee6cab87d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "({x}^{2}+1)(2{x}^{2}-7)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337848/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "675e46a1-6bdf-5bc0-a6b1-38954a9f8823" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-337848/selection/2ba3c326dd31af5a3a31342086047c8ca0cba4af4cd050440085abb1863140ff" :answer-field/choices ["q-337848/selection/7d1e573e2a541b95245397012198d28d2668125d7d9eca13de1e13591f5f44f7" "q-337848/selection/fb812ffd84da24ce1905765231549b8c11e7a6abc4700344a3e0ae39ccca6462" "q-337848/selection/2ba3c326dd31af5a3a31342086047c8ca0cba4af4cd050440085abb1863140ff" "q-337848/selection/707cc305f73f9e9a66cc6e545ada6c2812af62d26cf69d93ba13aec2868ca0c4" "q-337848/selection/32312e2fc4467bcf9f4791776f2c8ab86e5e7f4c222b59823acb03cb87c4681a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-337848" :question/id #uuid "1c2ef7fa-df26-5470-9ade-ea40c942ab20" :question/math-academy-id "q-337848" :question/problem "If $D(y)=y\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}-xy\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+5y,$ then $D({x}^{2}+1)=$" :question/worked-solution "The given operator is a second-order differential operator of the form\n\n$$\nD(y)={f}_{2}(x,y)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{f}_{1}(x,y)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{f}_{0}(x,y)y\n$$\n\nwith ${f}_{2}=y,{f}_{1}=-xy,$ and ${f}_{0}=5.$\n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y={x}^{2}+1:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D({x}^{2}+1) & =({x}^{2}+1)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}({x}^{2}+1)-x({x}^{2}+1)\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2}+1)+5({x}^{2}+1) \\\\  & =({x}^{2}+1)\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2x)-x({x}^{2}+1)\\cdot 2x+5({x}^{2}+1) \\\\  & =({x}^{2}+1)\\cdot 2-2{x}^{2}({x}^{2}+1)+5({x}^{2}+1) \\\\  & =2({x}^{2}+1)-2{x}^{2}({x}^{2}+1)+5({x}^{2}+1) \\\\  & =7({x}^{2}+1)-2{x}^{2}({x}^{2}+1) \\\\  & =({x}^{2}+1)(7-2{x}^{2})\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-337848/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7066d712-f0a3-554f-9d10-3d6fe4b95a18"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-337848"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-337972/selection/708733fd8e9aab003f52ea75f665cd42f0a00f7e6707b79c0bd318ce6ed50706" :answer/id #uuid "09cc59f6-f157-5749-afe3-93060045914b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3{e}^{-2x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337972/selection/7561fdb28b