er differential operator of the form\n\n$$\nD(y)={f}_{2}(x,y)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{f}_{1}(x,y)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{f}_{0}(x,y)y\n$$\n\nwith ${f}_{2}=y,{f}_{1}=2y,$ and ${f}_{0}=3y.$\n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y={e}^{-2x}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D({e}^{-2x}) & ={e}^{-2x}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}({e}^{-2x})+2({e}^{-2x})\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{-2x})+3{({e}^{-2x})}^{2} \\\\  & ={e}^{-2x}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-2{e}^{-2x})+2{e}^{-2x}\\cdot (-2{e}^{-2x})+3{e}^{-4x} \\\\  & ={e}^{-2x}\\cdot 4{e}^{-2x}-4{e}^{-4x}+3{e}^{-4x} \\\\  & =4{e}^{-4x}-4{e}^{-4x}+3{e}^{-4x} \\\\  & =3{e}^{-4x}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-337972/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7066d712-f0a3-554f-9d10-3d6fe4b95a18"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-337972"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-337983/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "f44ceaee-1a0b-540f-aa9f-18f125340cfb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337983/selection/73a38c2404534efbd7f74977930942e5c78ad554d157152878971289a7ee5945" :answer/id #uuid "20a7ff2b-db94-5e5e-a0e3-48ac17a063a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x(-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x+2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337983/selection/ff8a418274472b5120a2637ff380ef6a5eaf631fb100eb56c79be3263470a6aa" :answer/id #uuid "820dd39f-8642-5d66-a239-8b2dc44b0c40" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡x(-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337983/selection/76dc8413ee42647dfcc6d6fc1fd6a4492ea1e978b8d07aa57dd353c24a41a86a" :answer/id #uuid "4ba7e8c3-09ef-5bae-bd3a-2ce790790c26" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x(-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337983/selection/8c3bf13fcf9300cb0afaf9334a6c90848f37134262e7bcd3c72f7b2c9b3cf3cd" :answer/id #uuid "a0e3fabf-80cc-51df-8eff-2a188a6ce264" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{cos}^{2}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337983/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7c788fbe-78f4-5b9d-8284-0696002e1f41" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-337983/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-337983/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-337983/selection/73a38c2404534efbd7f74977930942e5c78ad554d157152878971289a7ee5945" "q-337983/selection/ff8a418274472b5120a2637ff380ef6a5eaf631fb100eb56c79be3263470a6aa" "q-337983/selection/76dc8413ee42647dfcc6d6fc1fd6a4492ea1e978b8d07aa57dd353c24a41a86a" "q-337983/selection/8c3bf13fcf9300cb0afaf9334a6c90848f37134262e7bcd3c72f7b2c9b3cf3cd"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-337983" :question/id #uuid "089313bf-aa19-5bee-bec7-d3a2e00b66aa" :question/math-academy-id "q-337983" :question/problem "If $D(y)=y\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+4{y}^{2},$ then $D(\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x)=$" :question/worked-solution "The given operator is a second-order differential operator of the form\n\n$$\nD(y)={f}_{2}(x,y)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{f}_{1}(x,y)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{f}_{0}(x,y)y\n$$\n\nwith ${f}_{2}=y,{f}_{1}=0,$ and ${f}_{0}=4y.$\n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D(\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x)+4{(\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x)}^{2} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x)+4{cos}^{2}⁡2x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x(-4\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x)+4{cos}^{2}⁡2x \\\\  & =-4{cos}^{2}⁡2x+4{cos}^{2}⁡2x \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-337983/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7066d712-f0a3-554f-9d10-3d6fe4b95a18"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-337983"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-338186/selection/da43738c9236c8b87e0a9f6992476b1eb6c036f4605ea927bfe2ac8c2b59dda5" :answer/id #uuid "8c0974e0-dc6b-55e3-b0cf-10dbd97c8a3a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2(-5-2{x}^{3}+3{x}^{6})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-338186/selection/ae7ae07741083473d038fac44ebbb88a87c13678ad4d5c3a401ebce79e75c973" :answer/id #uuid "809d361f-6bbd-5fbd-a257-e8a285392d0d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2(5+2{x}^{3}-3{x}^{6})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-338186/selection/e98aaa9f307fd27ba13c7ea2bcc8fc50c3cd4c9cd24cd43e58c01d5773403784" :answer/id #uuid "7b3885a3-32aa-5183-afda-538af85850ee" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2(5+2{x}^{3}+3{x}^{6})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-338186/selection/28aac6c614a1e5e116984fae5cf1d3e9dd760982e210f81537bbdbe32364453e" :answer/id #uuid "88e85596-2d61-5894-bb45-6e4b495704eb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2(5+4{x}^{3}-3{x}^{6})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-338186/selection/6a1b587c7bfb64cd6a90087211da380b7629c863fc257398d4a31638b65af7b0" :answer/id #uuid "d60cd5f6-a03d-5d72-8962-9483d11d44d7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2(5-2{x}^{3}-3{x}^{6})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-338186/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "16fe5a02-fa89-5de2-a248-1990411a8c1e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-338186/selection/ae7ae07741083473d038fac44ebbb88a87c13678ad4d5c3a401ebce79e75c973" :answer-field/choices ["q-338186/selection/da43738c9236c8b87e0a9f6992476b1eb6c036f4605ea927bfe2ac8c2b59dda5" "q-338186/selection/ae7ae07741083473d038fac44ebbb88a87c13678ad4d5c3a401ebce79e75c973" "q-338186/selection/e98aaa9f307fd27ba13c7ea2bcc8fc50c3cd4c9cd24cd43e58c01d5773403784" "q-338186/selection/28aac6c614a1e5e116984fae5cf1d3e9dd760982e210f81537bbdbe32364453e" "q-338186/selection/6a1b587c7bfb64cd6a90087211da380b7629c863fc257398d4a31638b65af7b0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-338186" :question/id #uuid "f1bdbb3c-0c65-5920-a3cb-125d513ba1ae" :question/math-academy-id "q-338186" :question/problem "If $D(y)=y\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}-2xy\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+4y,$ then $D({x}^{3}+1)=$" :question/worked-solution "The given operator is a third-order differential operator of the form\n\n$$\nD(y)={f}_{3}(x,y)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}+{f}_{1}(x,y)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{f}_{0}(x,y)y\n$$\n\nwith ${f}_{3}=y,{f}_{1}=-2xy,$ and ${f}_{0}=4.$\n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y={x}^{3}+1:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D({x}^{3}+1) & =({x}^{3}+1)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}({x}^{3}+1)-2x({x}^{3}+1)\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{3}+1)+4({x}^{3}+1) \\\\  & =({x}^{3}+1)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(3{x}^{2})-2x({x}^{3}+1)\\cdot 3{x}^{2}+4({x}^{3}+1) \\\\  & =({x}^{3}+1)\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(6x)-6{x}^{3}({x}^{3}+1)+4({x}^{3}+1) \\\\  & =({x}^{3}+1)\\cdot 6-6{x}^{3}({x}^{3}+1)+4({x}^{3}+1) \\\\  & =6({x}^{3}+1)-6{x}^{3}({x}^{3}+1)+4({x}^{3}+1) \\\\  & =10+4{x}^{3}-6{x}^{6} \\\\  & =2(5+2{x}^{3}-3{x}^{6})\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-338186/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7066d712-f0a3-554f-9d10-3d6fe4b95a18"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-338186"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
